   "content": "The lemon tree. The neighbors complained about it every summer — something about the roots, the property line, I never fully understood the argument. Grandma ignored them with a completeness that I found deeply satisfying. The lemons were too sour to eat plain. We made lemonade that was also too sour. We drank it anyway.",
