   "content": "The D'Aulaires' book had a spine that was already broken when I found it — it fell open to Persephone every time, which felt like the book was trying to tell me something. A girl who goes under the ground and comes back changed, and everyone argues about whether she wanted to go. I read that page so many times the paper went soft at the edges.",
