   "source": "seed",
   "content": "I read mythology the way other kids collected things. Not for fun exactly — more like I was building a vocabulary for somewhere I assumed I'd need to go eventually. The stories with doors in them were the ones I came back to. Doors, and what was on the other side, and whether you could come back through.",
