   "source": "seed",
   "content": "Derek carried groceries. He fixed the gate latch. He had one of those faces that looks trustworthy because it's unremarkable — nothing about it to catch on. Grandma had given him a key for emergencies. She trusted people the way she trusted fabric, by feel, and her feel for people was usually right. That is the part I can't put anywhere.",
