   "source": "seed",
   "content": "There is a night I don't go into. I know it happened. I know what it changed. The specific shape of it is somewhere I don't look, not because I've decided not to but because the decision was made so early and so completely that it feels like the shape was never there. I went quiet afterward. People said I seemed more grown-up.",
