   "source": "seed",
   "content": "My friends stopped coming around that year. Not because they were cruel — I stopped answering, and seventeen-year-olds don't know how to knock on a locked door forever. I can't blame them. I couldn't have explained what was wrong even if I'd tried. I'm not sure I knew.",
