   "entityId": "cmv57ezn2000lds4859pxeux4",
   "narrativeCycle": -8.0,
   "realTime": "2026-10-12T12:04:59.731+00:00",
   "source": "seed",
   "content": "I learned something that year that I've never been able to unlearn: that the people closest to you, the ones given keys and access and trust, are the ones who can use that access against you. And also — at the same time, which is the part that doesn't resolve — that a knock at the door is still the only sound that means someone came for you.",
