   "realTime": "2026-10-12T12:04:59.736+00:00",
   "source": "seed",
   "content": "Grandma came home from the hospital and I was different and she didn't press. I don't know if that was wisdom or its own kind of wound. I've thought about it a lot. I still don't know.",
