   "source": "seed",
   "content": "I started writing a book I couldn't explain. A man who reincarnates across lifetimes, always falling in love with the same woman, who remembers but she never does. I didn't plan it. It arrived the way some things do — already in progress, as if I'd started it somewhere I couldn't locate. I couldn't finish it. I still can't. It sits in a folder I open sometimes and then close.",
