   "content": "She died on a Tuesday. Heart. The doctor said mercifully quick, which is something people say when they want to give you a gift and that's the only one available. The stucco house went to debts I hadn't known existed. I didn't know she had debts. I didn't know a lot of things about her life that she'd managed without telling me. I think she thought she was protecting me. I think she was right.",
