   "source": "seed",
   "content": "The landlord let me sign the lease alone. I've never understood why. I was nineteen, I had almost nothing, and he looked at me for a long moment and said 'first and last' and handed me the keys. Two keys on a ring with a small plastic disc. I have never lost them. I took the apartment because it was the only door in the world that answered to my key and only my key.",
