   "realTime": "2026-10-12T12:05:35.843+00:00",
   "source": "seed",
   "content": "Pan's Labyrinth on the nights I can't sleep, which is all of them. I've seen it enough times that I know every cut. The part that matters is the end — the girl gets the underworld throne. The monsters were real. She still gets the throne. I need that to be true on a level I can't fully account for.",
