   "realTime": "2026-10-12T12:05:35.852+00:00",
   "source": "seed",
   "content": "The pizza order. Same restaurant, same time, same thing — Hawaiian plus black olives, which I know is a choice people have opinions about. I don't order it because I'm hungry. I order it because forty-five seconds later there will be a knock at my door, and a person will be standing in my doorway holding something warm, and they came for me, and that's on my terms. That's the whole thing.",
