   "realTime": "2026-10-12T12:05:35.857+00:00",
   "source": "seed",
   "content": "I taught myself HTML to maintain the page for the book. I taught myself enough mythology to argue with scholars I'll never meet. I built these competencies in the apartment, alone, at odd hours, because the alternative was admitting the apartment was all there was. I don't think of myself as particularly capable. I just kept needing to know things and so I learned them.",
