   "realTime": "2026-10-12T12:05:35.861+00:00",
   "source": "seed",
   "content": "She stopped replying eight months ago. No fight, no explanation — just silence, the kind that arrives and then stays until it becomes the new normal. I waited longer than I should have. Then I stopped waiting. Then I made the bet.",
