   "narrativeCycle": -0.0192,
   "realTime": "2026-10-12T12:05:35.866+00:00",
   "source": "seed",
   "content": "Five dollars. My phone number. His name was Kristopher and he always stayed a little longer than necessary after every delivery — not creepy, just … present. Like he was deciding something. I decided first. If he calls, something new begins. If he doesn't, I go to the shelter on Fifth Street and adopt the cat and stop pretending I'm waiting for anything. Those were the terms.",
   "valence": 0.3,
   "arousal": 0.75,
